        {
          "text": "Mbaaba bana ba-Israyeli, mbubakabalwa, bapati banzubo, abasilutwe bazyuulu abamyaanda, abasilutwe ibakali kubeleka milimo yamwami mumakani oonse aankamu zyabantu izyakali kubeleka milimo yamwezi umwi aumwi mumyezi yoonse yamwaka, Inkamu imwi aimwi yakali zyuulu zili makumi obile azine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
