        },
        {
          "text": "Jasobeamu mwana wa-Zabidiyeli kali silutwe wankamu intaanzi yamwezi mutaanzi. Munkamu yakwe kamuli bantu bali zyuulu zili makumi obile azine. ",
          "type": "text",
