        },
        {
          "text": "Oyu Benaya ngonguwe iwakali mwaalumi sintaze akati kabantu bali makumi otatwe, Kali mupati wabaabo bali makumi otatwe. Alakwe Amizabadi mwanaakwe kali silutwe wankamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.6"
            ]
