        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi silutwe wane wamumwezi wane kali Asaheli munyina joabu. Alakwe Zebadiya mwanaakwe kali musule lyakwe. Munkamu yakwe kamuli bantu bali zyuulu zili makumi obile azine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
