                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilutwe wamusanu aumwi wamumwezi wamusanu aumwi kali Ira mwana wa-Ikesi waku-Tekowa. Munkamu yakwe kamuli bantu bali zyuulu zili makumi obile azine, ",
