                  "text": "1 Mak 11:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilutwe wamusanu ababili wamumwezi wamusanu aibili kali Helezi mu-Peloni waluzubo lwa-Efraimu. Munkamu yakwe kamuli bantu bali zyuulu zili makumi obile azine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.10",
