        },
        {
          "text": "Asilutwe wamusanu abane wamumwezi wamusanu aine kali Abiezeri mu-Anatoti waluzubo lwa-Benjamini. Munkamu yakwe kamuli bantu bali zyuulu zili makumi obile azine. ",
